+## 8.2.1. How do you choose an appropriate life distribution model?
+## 8.2. Assumptions/Prerequisites
+## 8.2.1. How do you choose an appropriate life
+distribution model?
+Choose
+models that
+make sense,
+fit the data
+and,
+hopefully,
+have a
+plausible
