+Summary
+Statistics
+As a first step in the analysis, common summary statistics
+were computed from the data.
+ Sample size = 700
+ Mean = 2898.562
+ Median = 2899.000
+ Minimum = 2895.000
+ Maximum = 2902.000
+ Range = 7.000
