+# Model Picker Skill
+
+## Overview
+
+LLM provider selection and configuration interface supporting multiple OpenAI-compatible endpoints. Enables users to switch between local LLM providers (Ollama, LM Studio, llama.cpp) and cloud providers (OpenAI, custom) with runtime configuration and connection testing.
+
+## Purpose
+
+Model picker enables:
+
+- **Provider selection**: Choose from multiple LLM providers
+- **Runtime configuration**: Change provider without restarting backend
+- **Connection testing**: Test LLM endpoint before using
+- **Model listing**: Fetch available models from endpoint
+- **API key management**: Secure API key input (not persisted in localStorage)
+- **Provider presets**: Pre-configured defaults for common providers
+
+## Supported Providers
+
+### Local Providers
+
+**Ollama**
+- Default URL: `http://localhost:11434`
+- Models API: `/api/tags`
+- Use case: Local inference, privacy
+
+**LM Studio**
+- Default URL: `http://localhost:1234`
+- Models API: `/v1/models`
+- Use case: Local inference, GUI
+
+**llama.cpp**
+- Default URL: `http://localhost:8080`
+- Models API: `/v1/models`
+- Use case: Local inference, CPU/GPU
+
+**Unsloth**
+- Default URL: `http://127.0.0.1:8888`
+- Models API: `/v1/models`
+- Use case: Local inference, fine-tuning
+
+**LiteRT-LM**
+- Default URL: `http://localhost:9379`
+- Models API: `/v1/models`
+- Use case: Mobile/on-device inference
+
+### Cloud Providers
+
+**OpenAI**
+- Default URL: `https://api.openai.com/v1`
+- Models API: `/v1/models`
+- Use case: Cloud inference, GPT models
+
+**Custom**
+- User-specified URL
+- Models API: `/v1/models` (OpenAI-compatible)
+- Use case: Any OpenAI-compatible endpoint
+
+## Implementation
+
+### Component
+
+**File**: `frontend/src/components/ModelPicker.tsx`
+
+```typescript
+export function ModelPicker({
+  provider,
+  baseUrl,
+  apiKey,
+  model,
+  onProviderChange,
+  onBaseUrlChange,
+  onApiKeyChange,
+  onModelChange,
+  onTest
+}: ModelPickerProps) {
+  // Provider dropdown with presets
+  // Base URL input with normalization
+  // API key input (write-only)
+  // Model dropdown with refresh
+  // Test connection button
+}
+```
+
+### Provider Presets
+
+**File**: `frontend/src/types/llm.ts`
+
+```typescript
