+## Runtime Configuration
+
+### Persistence
+
+**Backend Persistence**:
+- Configuration saved to `backend/.llm_config.json`
+- API key saved to `backend/.llm_secret.enc` (encrypted)
+- Survives backend restart
+
+**Frontend Persistence**:
+- Provider, model, temperature saved to localStorage
+- API key NOT saved to localStorage (security)
+- Survives page refresh
+
+### Environment Fallback
+
+**Fallback Order**:
+1. Runtime config (`.llm_config.json`)
+2. Environment variables (`.env`)
+3. Defaults
+
+**Environment Variables**:
+- `LLM_API_BASE`: Default base URL
+- `LLM_API_KEY`: Default API key
+- `LLM_PROVIDER`: Default provider
+- `LLM_MODEL`: Default model
+- `LLM_TEMPERATURE`: Default temperature
+
+## Performance Characteristics
+
+- **Model listing**: < 1 second (local), < 2 seconds (cloud)
+- **Connection test**: < 5 seconds (includes test completion)
+- **Config save**: < 100ms
+- **Config load**: < 50ms
